{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grid space to clear your mind and create your own work. You can draw a floral path, a maze, a network of pipes, or some meaningless yet pleasing patterns\u2014anything you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723280/extras/f6a04e3a1bc7a8dd3ebef87659504c75.avif?t=1761058467\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has no objectives or true gameplay mechanics\u2014only connection and creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><u><i><strong>The game is still under development and will be updated periodically, with more content but no price increase. Thank you for your support.</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manual</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left mouse button: Place/remove blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right mouse button: Transform tile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse scroll wheel: Zoom in and out of the screen, hold and drag the canvas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features will included:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Map Canvas\u3011 A  grid space where you can click on each cell to fill or transform its content, generating continuously evolving tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Export Image\u3011 Export your grid space as an image to use as wallpaper, game assets, artwork, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Texture Packs\u3011 Plans to offer various texture packs, including not just flowers but also walls, houses, railways, and other world-building materials to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723280/extras/4df7450c31c0953190f995955df0ae57.avif?t=1761058467\" width=800 height=564 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2723280?t=1761058467","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2723280?t=1761058467","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723280/c1d23278a8aa5a7a523e24670ee84d0000893588/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761058467","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723280/c1d23278a8aa5a7a523e24670ee84d0000893588/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761058467","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grid space to clear your mind and create your own work. You can draw a floral path, a maze, a network of pipes, or some meaningless yet pleasing patterns\u2014anything you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723280/extras/f6a04e3a1bc7a8dd3ebef87659504c75.avif?t=1761058467\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has no objectives or true gameplay mechanics\u2014only connection and creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><u><i><strong>The game is still under development and will be updated periodically, with more content but no price increase. Thank you for your support.</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manual</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left mouse button: Place/remove blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right mouse button: Transform tile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse scroll wheel: Zoom in and out of the screen, hold and d